# Contains live production secrets or a dump of the live database
# (customer names, phone numbers, password hashes), or a hardcoded deploy key.
# Keep them out of version control; they live on the operator's machine.
DEPLOY.md
/data_live/
/docs/security/
/scripts/deploy-fix.php
# The other production diagnostics. Every one of them carries the same deploy
# key, so they are kept out the same way. They are listed one by one on
# purpose: a blanket pattern would hide a new file with a different name, and
# these are exactly the files that must never be committed by accident.
/scripts/db-diag.php
/scripts/db-diag2.php
/scripts/deploy-state.php
/scripts/migrate-refcounter.php
/scripts/repair-env.php
/scripts/verify-ref.php
/scripts/verify-static.php
/scripts/verify-static2.php
